---@field routeName? string The name of the Knative Route that this DomainMapping applies to. The route must exist.
---@field forceOverride? boolean If set, the mapping will override any mapping set before this spec was set. It is recommended that the user leaves this empty to receive an error warning about a potential conflict and only set it once the respective UI has given such a warning.

