---@field conditions? gcp.unstable.run_v1.GoogleCloudRunV1ConditionList Conditions communicate information about ongoing/complete reconciliation processes that bring the `spec` inline with the observed state of the world. * `Ready`: `True` when all underlying resources are ready.

